@startuml
title VPC-D04 Fee Calculation Sequence
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Vendor PMS connector" as Connector
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP\nnormal tariff authority" as Vendor
participant "Discount workflow\nwhere applicable" as Discount
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Central -> Connector : request live fee calculation
Connector -> Vendor : vendor fee calculation
Vendor --> Connector : fee result or fee exception
Connector --> Central : normalized fee outcome
alt fee result usable
  Central -> Discount : apply approved discount workflow if needed
  Discount --> Central : payable-basis effect
  Central -> Central : record TariffSnapshot
else fee unavailable / timeout / ambiguous
  Central -> Central : fail closed or route to approved degraded evaluation
end
Central -> Audit : record fee calculation context

note bottom
Projection and passageway records must not invent normal tariffs.
end note
@enduml
